    <string name="carset_vehicle_data_note">Adds a Vehicle data tile: a live, raw dump of the head unit\'s sensor channel. Field labels (speed, RPM, fuel...) are carried over from other reverse-engineering projects and unverified against this car - treat them as a guess, not a fact, until you\'ve watched one change for yourself.</string>
